OL,3,GNEWSAPaedophile with 'atrocious
OL,4,Aintentions' sent to jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "abominable" man who sent extreme
OL,7,Fpornographic and perverted messages has
OL,8,Fbeen jailed.
OL,10,FDaniel O'Flynn, 37, was arrested at
OL,11,FHull Paragon railway station a few days
OL,12,Fafter he started speaking on an
OL,13,Funregulated porn site to a decoy `
OL,14,Fsomeone he believed to be a registered
OL,15,Fsex offender who had a one-year-old
OL,16,Fchild.
OL,18,FHe was handed a 12-year sentence for a
OL,19,Fstring of offences at Hull Crown Court
OL,20,Fon 19 August, with nine years to be
OL,21,Fserved behind bars and a three-year
OL,22,Fextended licence period.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
