OL,5,
OL,6,FO'Flynn, from Hull, had previously
OL,7,Fpleaded guilty to arranging the
OL,8,Fcommission of the rape of a child,
OL,9,Fthree counts of making indecent
OL,10,Fphotographs of a child, possessing
OL,11,Fextreme pornography and theft.
